   108	/// Coarse process exit codes for shell and CI automation.
   109	///
   110	/// Values follow the Git convention: **128** for fatal runtime errors and
   111	/// **129** for usage / invalid-argument errors, so existing scripts that
   112	/// branch on Git's exit codes work unchanged with Libra.
